  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog 0.0.174\n\n## Changes (initial history)\n\n- feat: enforce aggregate SDK frame budgets (`7b2be6c`)\n- fix: enforce integer initializer type diagnostics (`8f427a1`)\n- feat: unify runner source across targets (`8aec7c1`)\n- fix: color NES Tiled backgrounds (`11f08e2`)\n- fix: improve NES runner visuals and camera parity (`9e8657e`)\n- feat: add NES runner parity (`7e2a525`)\n- feat: add NES runner sample (`79742ff`)\n- test: cover world.load camera scroll path on both targets (`74bc30d`)\n- feat: land tiled world.load on nes from shared logical map (`4710c7c`)\n- refactor: share png decode and canonical tile quantization in core (`f350d8b`)\n- docs: record aggregate frame-budget enforcement decision for sdk (`26c936e`)\n- refactor: single-source dot-call receiver vs sdk precedence (`55b1f00`)\n- feat: infer integer width suffix for let and const (`3e48b00`)\n- refactor: extract neutral tiled map model from game boy importer (`8ba2c3b`)\n- fix: validate flag queries and constant initializers (`f3928d9`)\n- feat: add logical palette declarations (`2f890b9`)\n- feat: add camera hit-top collision query (`8ed1529`)\n- test: document nes collision capability gap (`198c8fc`)\n- feat: stabilize camera-relative collision query (`463cd11`)\n- docs: reconcile sdk stabilization backlog (`049cdca`)\n- feat: add game boy BGM playback (`c31aada`)\n- fix: block runner pipe side collisions (`d4cadf2`)\n- fix: wait for fresh vblank before gb camera streaming (`8ab0101`)\n- fix: cap game boy camera streaming (`7530afc`)\n- feat: advance portable sdk operation roadmap (`6ca5f3e`)\n- docs: record sprite-model design decision and next-agent handoff (`d7b4206`)\n- docs: document SDK layer boundary and the golden rule (`c5c6e98`)\n- refactor: move SDK operation collector out of the language assembly (`2335028`)\n- docs: record portability lowering roadmap progress (epic #106) (`cb8fd95`)\n- test: add cross-target scroll acceptance and NES CollectSdkOperations (`0f1df39`)\n- refactor: drive NES camera through the shared SDK operation lowerer (`c09c63b`)\n- refactor: add NES SDK operation lowerer for WaitFrame and PollInput (`c494240`)\n- refactor: drive Game Boy camera apply through the SDK operation lowerer (`f2913a6`)\n- refactor: drive Game Boy camera position through the SDK operation lowerer (`aae77aa`)\n- refactor: drive Game Boy input poll through the SDK operation lowerer (`bbb7cfe`)\n- refactor: extract Tiled collision interpretation into shared SDK layer (`deca260`)\n- refactor: share the SDK operation collector across targets (`e6b8cc1`)\n- fix: only charge camera streaming budget on streaming targets (`4d7a49c`)\n- refactor: move SDK module knowledge out of the language layer (`513031e`)\n- feat: reject out-of-width constant casts (`290228f`)\n- fix: sync game boy runner scroll collision (`36e9e51`)\n- fix: sync game boy camera tile streaming to vblank (`4a8a18d`)\n- docs: add ai agent workflow guidance (`85c3a8e`)\n- fix: align game boy tiled map backgrounds (`d3eff99`)\n- fix: support tiled runner scale and collision (`72013c5`)\n- feat: add Tiled maps to Game Boy runner (`6f7d91e`)\n- feat: add static class language support (`de95788`)\n- feat: improve sample language ergonomics (`31f293c`)\n- docs: migrate samples to post-v1 language surface (`e5cd653`)\n- feat: complete post-v1 language surface (`830659f`)\n",
